  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.3 - Attribute-Based Query Building\n      • New [TableName], [TableAlias], [ColumnName], [IgnoreColumn] attributes\n      • Strongly-typed query building with Table<T>(), Field<T>(), ColumnName<T>()\n      • Auto-generate SELECT columns with AddAllColumns<T>()\n      • Auto-aliasing when column name differs from property name\n      • GenerateSelectQuery<T>() for quick query scaffolding",
